2026-10-03  Matevz Tadel  <matevz.tadel@ijs.si>

	Converted the pod documents to GitHub markdown and moved them from
	pod/ and papers/greed-design-docs/ into docs/.  The pod files used
	extensions of pod3, a private Pod::POM fork that no longer runs on
	current Perl.

	* gledarch.md, gledimp.md:
	Moved from pod/gledarch.pod and pod/gledimp.pod.
	Updated the gled --help listing in gledimp.md to the current output,
	which adds --root-web, --pidfile and --logflush.  Noted that --daemon is
	only listed by saturn --help.

	* gled-dev.md, greed-databases.md, greed-sounds.md,
	greed-tech-workplan.md, greedworld-gled-object-spaces.md,
	greedworld-prototype-tasks.md:
	Moved from papers/greed-design-docs/.
	Replaced the LaTeX macros \greed, \gled, \greedhome and the like with
	the plain names.

	Rewrote the pod3 lists (=over enum, list and def, =item<term>) as
	numbered lists, bullet lists, and bullets that open with the term in
	bold.  Fixed an =item*, a \item and a =head2<...> that pod3 accepted.
	Removed the svn:keywords property, as the $Id$ lines were not carried
	over.

	* ChangeLog:
	Moved from pod/ChangeLog.  Merged in the one entry of
	papers/greed-design-docs/ChangeLog.

	* Makefile:
	Moved from pod/Makefile.  Replaced the pod3 rules for html, pdf and ps
	with a pandoc rule for html.  Removed the publish target, which copied
	the html to www.gled.org.

2026-10-02  Matevz Tadel  <matevz.tadel@ijs.si>

	* gledimp.pod:
	Described gled-create libset|glass|stone|rnr in place of the four
	gled-create-<what> scripts.  'gled-create libset' creates the symlink
	that configure needs, and 'gled-create glass' and 'gled-create rnr'
	maintain glass.list.
	Described the per-directory dictionaries: rootcling in place of
	rootcint, and the classes other than glasses listed in <Dir>/LinkDef.h.
	Described what make does without configure: it picks up new glasses
	from glass.list, and runs project7 on headers that include their own
	.h7.  Removed the class catalogues, build_libsets, make pre_depend and
	make_p7.inc, which no longer exist.
	Stated that all classes are in namespace gled, that ZGlass is not a
	TObject, and that stones need a ClassDef and a LinkDef.h entry instead
	of a TObject base.
	Removed the link to the html class documentation, which was made with
	THtml.  Named cling as the interpreter in place of CINT, except for the
	'Export to CINT' menu entry, which keeps that name.

